    "make_it":  [
                    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet and brown 6.6 pounds of 93/7 ground turkey with the chopped onion and the minced garlic.",
                    "Boil the penne pasta separately until just shy of tender, then drain.",
                    "Stir in the tomato paste along with the cumin, paprika, chili powder, and garlic powder and cook a minute so the spices bloom in the fat.",
                    "Add the black beans, diced tomatoes, and chicken broth, season with the salt and black pepper, and simmer 10 to 12 minutes until it thickens into chili.",
                    "Fold in the cooked pasta so every noodle catches the chili.",
                    "Melt the fat-free cheddar over the top and stir it through before you portion it out."
